                (t("I did not know what judicial review is and guessed.", "No sabía qué es la revisión judicial y elegí al azar."), 0),
                (t("I knew it, but the graph was in percents and I answered as if they were totals.", "Lo sabía, pero la gráfica estaba en porcentajes y respondí como si fueran totales."), 1),
